%% expect: Browser|Authorization Server|Resource API|Redirect to the login page with the client id|Authorization code exchange|Access token and refresh token|Token is valid|Token expired|Refresh the access token before retrying|retry up to three times|The token is cached in memory only and never written to disk
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant A as Authorization Server
    participant R as Resource API
    B->>A: Redirect to the login page with the client id
    activate A
    A-->>B: Authorization code exchange
    deactivate A
    B->>A: POST /token with the code and PKCE verifier
    A-->>B: Access token and refresh token
    Note over B,A: The token is cached in memory only and never written to disk
    loop retry up to three times
        B->>+R: GET /documents with bearer token
        alt Token is valid
            R-->>B: 200 with the list of documents
        else Token expired
            R-->>-B: 401 Unauthorized
            B->>A: Refresh the access token before retrying
            A--xB: Refresh rejected, sign in again
        end
    end
